{"id":"vod_sn_38442","vodId":"38442","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"王室教师海涅","name_cn":"王室教师海涅","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/87f90cac2209c6cb2a5f177f8f8fc497.jpg"},"summary":"海涅（植田圭辅 配音）拥有着小巧的身材和可爱的外貌，身为一个完完全全的普通人的他，既没有显赫的身世撑腰，亦没有受过什么高等的教育，却在意想不到之中被选中成为了“王室教师”。他的任务是从四位个性迥异的王子中选择可塑之才，将其培养成为继承王位的候补者。　　拥有着比女子还要秀美的容貌却生活在深深的自卑之中的莱恩哈特（广濑大介 配音）、满腹诗书个性固执而又极端的布鲁诺（安达勇人 配音）、开朗乐观平易近人的里希特（苍井翔太 配音）、外表冷峻令人无法接近实际上却喜欢可爱的东西的凯（安里勇哉 配音），这些并不服从管教的熊王子们会给海涅出怎样的难题呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0nn8ze1yny1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N35wDUszpK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jdwi4AwV7q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jgzGmSv5ge1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Z5WMZSdst1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3S8fUADiZq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mZXHQMjVaM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QU42PBchEs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C7P2mxrhc01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kzqZXrx6Bq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qcsWb9Cyeq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G2aEhmRwkF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.969Z"}